sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Shoppers as 10,000 Concurrent Shoppers
    participant CF as Cloudflare WAF / Edge
    participant GW as Envoy API Gateway
    participant IS as Inventory Core Service
    participant R as Redis 7 In-Memory Cluster

    Note over Shoppers,R: FLASH SALE LAUNCH (T=00:00.000) - 10,000 RPS Surge targeting 100 Units
    Shoppers->>CF: POST /api/v1/checkout/reserve (10,000 requests)
    CF->>CF: Validate Turnstile & Rate Limits
    CF->>GW: Forward 10,000 requests

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over GW,R: Phase 1: The 100 Winning Allocations (Req 1 to 100)
    GW->>IS: Invoke reserve_stock(sku, userId)
    IS->>R: EVALSHA atomic_reserve_v1.lua
    R->>R: 1. Idempotency Check: (key not found)
    R->>R: 2. Stock Check: stock >= 1 (Available)
    R->>R: 3. DECRBY stock 1 (Remaining: 99..0)
    R->>R: 4. SET lease_key EX 300 (300s TTL)
    R->>R: 5. ZADD lease_timeline expiresAt
    R-->>IS: Return Success: {code: 0, resvId, expiresAt}
    IS-->>GW: HTTP 201 Created
    GW-->>Shoppers: HTTP 201 Created (100 Leases Granted)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
    Note over GW,R: Phase 2: The 9,900 Fast-Failed Contenders (Req 101 to 10,000)
    GW->>IS: Invoke reserve_stock(sku, userId)
    IS->>R: EVALSHA atomic_reserve_v1.lua
    R->>R: 1. Stock Check: stock == 0 (Depleted)
    R-->>IS: Return Rejection: {code: 2, status: "INVENTORY_EXHAUSTED"}
    IS->>GW: Flip Local Gateway In-Memory Flag (sold_out = true)
    IS-->>GW: HTTP 409 Conflict
    GW-->>Shoppers: HTTP 409 Conflict (9,900 Rejections in < 15ms)
    end

    Note over GW,Shoppers: Gateway Fast-Circuit Active: Subsequent requests dropped locally in 0.1ms
